title: "RadarSim: a look-by-look radar simulator"
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
url: "https://spaceengineerss.github.io/RadarSim/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SpaceEngineerSS/RadarSim"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - radar
  - simulation
  - detection
  - cfar
  - electronic-warfare
  - target-tracking
authors:
  - name: "RadarSim Contributors"
abstract: >-
  RadarSim simulates surveillance and fire-control radars look by look:
  radar-equation detection with pulse compression, Swerling targets and
  CFAR loss, ITU-R propagation, terrain masking, land, sea and rain
  clutter with MTI, noise and DRFM jamming, chaff and decoys, and
  track-while-scan tracking. It includes a desktop console, a headless
  command line, coverage and Monte Carlo analysis, and a coherent
  pulse-Doppler and SAR processing chain. It is intended for engineering
  studies and teaching.
